FF-680W: no document tone curves or DS-530 colour matrix.

epsonds groups the FastFoto FF-680W with the DS-530 document scanners (LUT id 2),
so every colour scan uploads tone curves that crush inputs 0-39 to black and clip
210 and up to white, and applies the DS-530 colour matrix. LUT id 0 uploads the
identity curves and skips the matrix: the scanner's own response at gamma 1.8,
which a colour profile can then correct.
--- a/backend/epsonds.c
+++ b/backend/epsonds.c
@@ -1243,1 +1243,1 @@
-  {0x016B, "FF-680W","FF-680W", 2},
+  {0x016B, "FF-680W","FF-680W", 0},
